    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17487" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐξ-ητικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>growing, of growth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ αὐ. ζωή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1098a1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Juv.</u>
					469a26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐ. εἰς μῆκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					1.9.1
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς, κινεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.492
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>promoting growth,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπληνός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					62
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγέθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					3.24
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					745a3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κόν, τό,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cael.</u>
				310a29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>amplificatory,</i> in Rhet., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1368a10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				11.2
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					38.2
				</span></i>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				221 ix 31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>productive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aq.
				<u>Is.</u>
				32.12
			</span></i>.</div>
